@ 33.3.2.2.4 - Valley Yokuts to Chukchansi
# citation: CatDoom, from Whistler, Kenneth W., and Golla, Victor (1986), “Proto-Yokuts Reconsidered”. International Journal of American Linguistics Vol. 52, No. 4 (Oct. 1986)
	# /s ʃ ʂ/ may be a single alternating phoneme
	ʈ ʈʰ ʈʼ → tʃ tʃʰ tʃʼ
	tʃ tʃʰ tʃʼ → ts tsʰ tsʼ